<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Locate Object</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 19), Druid (guild level 35)
Also taught by: Brother Norcia, at the monastery in the vineyards near Nymgaard (from level 50)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast locate object &lt;object&gt;
</pre>
<p>Gives you a sense of where an object is: you see it, and where it lies, the 
room it is in, or the one who carries it. It looks in your own area first, 
and then in the whole world, and it finds one such object, the first it 
comes to. An object with magic of its own may resist it.
</p><p>If the spell fails, you feel confused; if it fails badly, the one who has 
the object realizes that you tried to locate it. You must be standing, and 
you can't cast it while fighting. It is also found on scrolls. Practising 
it needs divine 32.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
